Audience desires and goals
title end

paragraph start
Desires are what people want to become or achieve, written in their own words: a result, a feeling or a change in daily life. Record the goal and the obstacle together.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Pair every desire with a problem from the ranked list, so content can move a person from the problem to the goal.
paragraph end

